I'm glad to see you figured out how to make a team of robots.
Did you notice that the robot first in line is the one that checks
out the box first? Now we are ready to make an alarm clock.
Even ships need alarm clocks to remind them (and me!) to do things.
See if you can get a bird to wait exactly 25 seconds before flying off
with a message. Bring me her nest before she delivers the message.
This one is a bit tricky so I'll probably have to give you some
help. Give it a try.

Start robots and 
then bring back
the empty nest.

This is the result of saving everything in a room.
