Did you give the box to the robot you trained earlier?

Did you use Dusty to erase 3000 in the robot's thought bubble?

Did you give the box back to the old robot?

Did you leave the room and wait 25 seconds and sit down again?

Did you give the box to the new robot?

Did you train the robot to pick up the "Ring Ring" message and
give it to the bird?

Did you drop one of the robots on the other to make a team?

Did you empty out the second hole of the box?

Did you put the extra zero into the empty hole?

Did you give the box to the robots, pick up the nest and hurry
back here?

So here's what I would do if I could.  I'd give the box to the
old robot.  Then I'd erase the 3000 in his thought bubble.
Then I'd give him the box again and leave the room for at least 25
seconds.  Then I'd give the box to the other robot.  I'd train
the robot to pick up the message in the last hole and drop it
on the bird.  I'd erase the second number in his thought
bubble.  Then I'd drop one of the robots on the other.  This
time it doesn't matter which one goes first.  I'd take out the
number in the second hole put the 0 in its place.  Then I'd
give the box to the team of robots, pick up the nest and get
quickly out of there.


